WEBVTT

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.000
I thought I was beat up pretty badly,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.400
but I'm not too swollen.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.410
What's wrong, Wanpo?

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.910
T-Takamura-san!

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.040
What are you doing with Wanpo?

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:29.920
I'm taking him...

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.540
to the beach!

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.010
The beach?

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:33.910
Why?

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.050
The three of us are going for a training camp.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.290
Good morning!

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.050
Yo!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.050
We've all got matches in October!

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.060
So we're doing our usual training camp at the beach.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.010
Then can I come-

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:46.980
Dumbass!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.640
Your fight just ended.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:51.660
Aren't you supposed to take three weeks off?

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.650
Wanpo's your replacement.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:57.250
<i>But he doesn't seem to want to go.</i>

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.740
I've been worried this dog hasn't been getting enough exercise for a while now.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.340
We'll help him with his weight control!

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.310
Come on, Wanpo!

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.270
Enjoy your rest, Senpai!

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.060
Yo, Ippo!

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.260
Hey, what's with the surprised look?

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.630
We're going to the beach!

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.770
Want to come along?

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:32.930
Thanks for the offer,

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.840
but I'm not really in the mood for fun.

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.860
Makunouchi-san isn't coming?

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.870
K-Kumi-san!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.870
I agreed to come because I heard you were going.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.980
Move it, move it, move it!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.400
Excuse us! Sorry!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.980
Pardon us, we're in the middle of training!

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.670
He seems kind of tense.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.920
He just wants to blow off some steam.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.270
His world title match got delayed after all.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.990
Still, it's pretty impressive.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:32.630
He's running twice as much since he's zigzagging everywhere,

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.500
but he doesn't seem tired at all.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.260
I'm impressed that you can keep up with us!

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.940
Ippo got worn out at his first training camp.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:42.610
I'm glad that it's tough.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:45.260
I chose this gym because it had that kind of reputation.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.910
It seems like there's something more that you're not saying...

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.120
Just a bit of personal business.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.100
Excuse me!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.520
Could you throw the ball back here?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.770
Oh, no... {jama: added}

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:59.010
Better pretend I don't know him.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.230
Excuse me! Could you throw the ball here?

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:04.740
You've got some nerve...

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.030
hitting me with this thing!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.810
Why are you here?

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:13.930
Um... {jama: added}

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.790
I think you've mistaken me for someone else.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:19.110
Then why's the dog clinging to you?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.050
He's running!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.710
Wait!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.050
Makunouchi-san, did you get the ball-

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:29.800
No!

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.260
T-Takamura-sa-

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.480
You bastards!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.940
Taking a vacation with your girls!?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.700
And rubbing it in our faces!?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.110
I-It was just a coincidence!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.830
What!? {jama: added}

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.070
Wanpo,

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:49.740
are you trying to protect your master!?

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.050
I'm the guy who beat up a bear, all right!?

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:54.870
I could turn you into mincemeat in three seconds!

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:55.750
Huh? {jama: added}

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.720
H-Hachi?

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.250
Why would he be...

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:03.750
My, my...  You guys sure are a boisterous bunch-dani!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.460
That voice!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.540
Nekota-san!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.970
Have some corn on the cob-dani!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.710
Who's that?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.370
The coach's best friend.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.850
When they were both active boxers, they fought to a standstill.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.190
That's pretty impressive.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:26.090
I heard Gen-chan sent you on a training camp, so I came down for a bit-dani.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.990
This is boring.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.370
I'm outta here!

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.780
We should get back to work too.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.370
It really was a coincidence, but...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.140
I kind of feel bad about it.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.240
Yeah.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.710
Especially since everyone else is training so hard.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.000
No.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.520
Aoki and Makunouchi, you both fought hard-dani.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.010
Fighters need to enjoy their time off too-dani.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:53.050
When you put it that way...

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:56.050
And so, that being the case...

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.910
I'm going to splash you-dani! Let's enjoy ourselves-dani!  {Solo-  line needs a split}

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.620
This must be what he was really after.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.070
I think so.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.900
Here it goes!

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.200
<i>She's so cute.</i>

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.030
Aoki-san...

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.460
Thanks for today.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.580
What're you talking about?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.630
I was down because I fought Yamada-kun,

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.840
but having so much fun today...

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.380
I feel a lot better.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.350
Having fun, huh?

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.640
Ippo, my boy...

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.510
It's only getting started.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.390
We've got two rooms.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.730
Naturally, Tomiko and I will be sharing a room and we'll have <i>fun</i>.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.730
Show her what kind of man you are!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:50.420
A-Aoki-san?

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.240
You <i>know</i> what I'm talking about!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.240
It wasn't a day trip!?

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:05.710
K-Kumi-san, did you know about this?

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.710
I...

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.390
I thought I was going to be sharing a room with Tomiko-san.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.720
U-Um...

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.640
Y-Yes!?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.030
Want to get some fresh air?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:21.240
Take a walk!?

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.590
That's a great idea!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:23.730
Okay.

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.280
<i>Now that I think about it...</i>

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.690
<i>I keep letting chances like this pass me by.</i>

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.840
<i>Today...</i>

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.250
<i>This time I'll say it!</i>

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.420
Makunouchi-san?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.620
Y-Yes?

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.760
It's nice, isn't it?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.420
Oh, right.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.200
<i>Today, I'll tell her...</i>

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.130
<i>This time...</i>

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:57.110
W-What's wrong?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.930
Over there!

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.560
There's nothing there.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.640
But it was glowing a second ago!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.650
Look, it did it again!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.650
This is scary... Let's go back.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.220
I've heard about this before.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.160
When you see round, floating lights...

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.120
don't go near the water.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:23.270
You'll think you're standing on the shore,

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.680
but all of sudden you'll be up to your waist in the ocean.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:31.610
You'll want to rush out, but your legs won't move forward.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.170
When you get scared,

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.180
and try to lift up your leg...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.180
dozens of pale white hands will grab hold of you,

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.420
trying to drag you into the sea.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.950
No! {jama: added}

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.200
No!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.020
Please stop it!

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.930
<i>What a great story.</i>

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.980
It's just some made-up story.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.490
Look over there!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.420
It was just fireworks!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.370
So pretty...

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.490
<i>I've decided!</i>

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.910
<i>The next firework...</i>

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.000
<i>When the next firework goes off, I'll tell her...</i>

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:10.500
<i>that I like her!</i>

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.640
Keep your head down.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.090
Make your approach on all fours.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.670
Kimura-san...

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:23.930
is this part of the training?

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:25.350
Hell if I know.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.070
There they are. {jama: added}

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:33.500
Couples at the beach have their guard down...

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.440
so it's easy to get close.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:38.030
This is just voyeurism.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.750
Bastard, dragging us along for this...

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.640
Don't...

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.700
Come on baby...

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.870
T-They're pretty bold.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.790
I-It's pretty intense.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:56.710
Should we get a little closer?

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:00.810
Amazing.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.930
It's like you've got four hands.

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.970
Don't participate, damn it!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.630
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.890
<i>Should I stick around until the end?</i>

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.980
<i>Will I be able to without getting caught?</i>

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.230
Itagaki, get ready to run.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:24.450
Why is everybody here!?

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.350
What the hell are you letting me touch!?

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.020
No! {jama: added}

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.120
You wanna die, Takamura!?

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.320
Let's go, Itagaki!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.370
R-Right!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.880
Kumi-san, we should go too!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.130
R-Right!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.930
I'll remember this!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.870
I'm the one who should be saying that!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.010
Damn it, what a maniac.

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.340
Molesting an acquaintance like that.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.730
Where'd the Lord of the Perverts go?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.270
Huh? I thought he was with us.

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:58.930
Man, what a mess.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.480
To think that Aoki and the others would be there...

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:06.280
Still, Tomiko's got a nice pair on her!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.000
What is it, Wanpo?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.520
How'd I get here?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.390
Huh?

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.500
I can't move!?

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.520
Something's stuck on my legs!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.020
What the hell!?

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.490
T-This isn't good!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:31.770
<i>Don't turn around.</i>

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.630
<i>If I turn around now...</i>

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.290
It's too scary!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.480
Wanpo, save me!

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:44.200
Don't run!

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.700
Have mercy!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.750
I might be the strongest man in the world, but ghosts are something else entirely!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.770
<i>And with a world match almost within my grasp...</i>

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.920
<i>My world match...</i>

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.970
<i>The world...</i>

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:06.760
No way in hell am I giving up!

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:08.220
You piece of shit!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.720
Where are you!?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.220
Show yourself!

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:13.540
What's wrong, Wanpo!?

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.130
Did something happen!?

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:17.940
What is it?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.110
Kimura-san, there's a washed up corpse!

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.610
It's Nekota-san!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.120
He's still breathing.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.350
He looks like he got his ass kicked.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.030
Where are you!?

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.510
What's up with him?

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.370
He's going berserk.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:39.710
I was just playing around, but he really let me have it-dani.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.400
I ain't afraid of no ghosts!

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:45.690
What do you think happened?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.070
Probably something stupid.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:50.990
Damn it, I can't believe that guy.

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:52.990
You drank too much, Masaru!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:54.920
Can you blame me for drinking after that!?  {Solo-  TLC:  Suggested line Can you blame me after that!?}

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.710
Sorry, Kumi.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.440
We'll go back to our room!

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.180
Come on, Masaru!

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:03.150
H-Hey! Wait a minute, just one more!

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:09.010
We ended up drinking too.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.660
I just had a little!

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.470
Oh, really?

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:16.620
You're so serious, Makunouchi-san.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:20.080
It'd be nice if you could relax a little.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:24.450
Do you remember when we first met?

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.090
I was working at the bakery.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:32.850
And after that, you ended up at our hospital by coincidence.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.810
I was so happy.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.380
Um...

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.830
Maybe, I had too much to drink!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.260
I'm talking too much.

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.110
But even if it was a coincidence,

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:55.120
I was really... really happy!

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.670
I...

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:58.310
I...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.370
Wait a second!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.830
I'll...

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:06.410
take it from here.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.600
I'll...

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.850
take it from here.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.310
U-Um...

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.610
It's... just that...

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:27.860
<i>Quit mumbling!</i>

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.110
<i>Just say it!</i>

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:31.250
<i>I like you, Kumi-san!</i>

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.410
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.080
<i>let's just be friends.</i>

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.390
<i>What if that happens?</i>

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.560
<i>Don't think about the worst case scenario!</i>

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.660
<i>Brace yourself!</i>

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:48.840
<i>Compared to Sendo-san and Date-san's punches, this isn't...</i>

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.340
<i>scary at all!</i>

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.260
<i>I-It's a totally different kind of scary!</i>

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.600
Um, Makunouchi-san?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.140
I'm still going to say it!

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.300
<i>What am I supposed to do?</i>

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.860
<i>When you're in trouble...</i>

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.300
<i>...use a jab!</i>

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.060
<i>That's it!</i>

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:13.210
<i>You can't start off too strong.</i>

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.370
<i>First, start off with something like a jab.</i>

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.560
Actually...

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.640
the first time we met...

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.000
was during a match Miyata-kun had at the hall.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.950
You sat next to me.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.960
Then I saw you at the bakery...

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:30.300
and I kept going there.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:33.410
I think the reason I kept going there...

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:35.550
was because it made me happy to see you.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:38.040
When I saw you at the hospital...

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.510
and at the group date...

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.270
I'd been thinking about you a lot.

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.480
I've...

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.190
I've always liked you,

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.640
Kumi-san!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.560
S-So...

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.700
that's why...

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:57.990
Kumi-san?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.400
My wind-up was too long.

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:09.710
Well, she did have a lot to drink.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.750
But even if she didn't hear me...

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:15.720
I finally said it!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:17.260
For tonight,

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.720
I'll congratulate myself for that!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.020
Hold it right there!

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.710
You two seem different today.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:38.740
Did you finally become...

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:40.530
a man?

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.240
You did it, right?

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.840
With Kumi-chan...

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.960
What are you talking about!?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.860
Come on, it's fine!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.480
After all, you're already 20!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.750
Would you listen?

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:53.910
So...

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:56.260
You're grateful to me, right?

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:58.440
Grateful?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.760
This happened because I invited you to the beach.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.250
It's your turn to help me out.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:08.650
Well, if it's something I can help with...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.940
It's revenge.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:15.370
That bastard, Takamura, fondled my Tomiko's breasts.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.950
How would you feel in my position?

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.570
I would be really mad!

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:23.700
Even so, if I fight him 1-on-1...

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:25.160
I'll lose.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:27.760
And if I try to jump him...

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.540
that sixth sense of his would let him know I was coming.

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:32.720
Which is why...

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.730
Ippo! Get that one! The big one!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.400
R-Right!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.600
I got it!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.720
All right.

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:50.230
Now, I'm gonna stuff this in the okonomiyaki I bought at the food stand.

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:54.500
Um, why not use a crab instead?

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.770
Moron!

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:58.190
A crab would probably taste good!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.200
I guess so...

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:12.630
Itagaki and Kimura are sparring.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:16.870
So fast!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.050
He's faster than Kimura.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:23.800
I guess being the national inter-high runner up actually means something after all.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.710
What's up, Ippo?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.060
Oh, nothing.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.210
It kind of makes me want to...

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:41.360
Quit squirming.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.470
But, I just...

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.330
Stupid Wanpo! Now they know we're here!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.670
Come to check up on us?

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.000
<i>A-Aoki...</i>

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.840
<i>Yesterday was pretty bad.</i>

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:02.690
<i>I planned on apologizing after things cooled off some.</i>

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:07.230
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.070
<i>Seeing that face makes me want to slap him, not apologize.</i>

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.940
Takamura-san...

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.670
Why don't you two make up?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.020
But...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.050
If you can't apologize,

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.590
why don't you try complimenting him on something?

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.440
<i>Compliment?</i>

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.250
<i>What...</i>

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.740
<i>What about Aoki could I possibly...</i>

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.700
H-Hey... Aoki...

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:32.090
<i>Compliment him.</i>

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.240
<i>Compliment something.</i>

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.220
Aoki...

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.470
T-Tomiko has...

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.910
some really sweet tits!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.080
Are you trying to piss him off even more, dumbass!?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.460
I'm complimenting him in my own way!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.100
It doesn't bother me!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.560
But since we disrupted your training...

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.900
Here, you can have this!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:00.060
Okonomiyaki, huh?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.400
Thanks, man!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.250
<i>Now, eat it!</i>

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.660
<i>Your special giant sea slater flavored okonomiyaki!</i>

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.050
<i>Eat it up!</i>

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.790
But, you know...

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.790
To be honest, I was the one at fault for what happened, so...

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:24.260
Let's split it!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.800
<i>Oh, crap! {jama: added}</i>

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.960
U-Uh, no... I'm fine...

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.430
Takamura-san, go ahead and eat the whole thing!

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.080
What's up with that?

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.300
Well, that's kind of suspicious!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.080
Is there something gross inside?

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:41.560
Oh, of course not!  No way!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.030
<i>Are you freaking psychic!?</i>

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:46.680
Here, don't be shy!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.830
<i>W-Which is it?</i>

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.540
<i>Left or right...</i>

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.830
<i>Which one has it inside?</i>

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.520
<i>Which is it?</i>

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.050
<i>That's it!</i>

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:08.150
<i>This guy's sixth sense is better than I thought!</i>

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.880
<i>It's this one!</i>

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.550
<i>No doubt about it!</i>

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.450
Then, I guess I'll have the smaller one...

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:15.060
Here ya go!

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.070
It's good!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.670
<i>It was supposed to be a subtle revenge,</i>

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.990
<i>but it ended in tears.</i>

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.910
Aoki-san...

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.830
Did you hit the jackpot?

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:37.070
The sauce was so strong...

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.200
I couldn't tell.
